cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use dune-bayes, cite this repository release and, once available, the
  author-approved dune-bayes paper/preprint listed as the preferred citation.
title: dune-bayes
authors:
  - family-names: Kruse
    given-names: R.-M.
abstract: >-
  DUNE (Distributional Uncertainty in Neural-additive Estimation) provides
  Bayesian additive models for location, scale, and shape with mean-field
  variational inference in PyTorch.
keywords:
  - Bayesian additive models
  - distributional regression
  - neural additive models
  - variational inference
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/RMKruse/dune-bayes
url: https://github.com/RMKruse/dune-bayes
version: 0.1.0.dev0
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "DUNE: Distributional Uncertainty in Neural-additive Estimation"
  authors:
    - family-names: Kruse
      given-names: R.-M.
  year: 2026
  url: https://github.com/RMKruse/dune-bayes
  notes: >-
    Paper DOI/preprint citation pending author approval; replace this
    preferred-citation before tagging the paper artifact release.
